{"id":"b436d71d5fb5","path":"/en/university/info/career/companies/company-profiles","lang":"en","title":"Company profiles","description":"Cerchi uno stage, un lavoro, una collaborazione di tesi, un field project? Scopri le realtà professionali che collaborano con l'USI: chi sono, dove operano e quali opportunità offrono agli studenti e laureati USI.","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Career","Companies"],"image":null,"words":98,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/career/aziende/company-profiles","en":"/en/university/info/career/companies/company-profiles"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Career","path":"/en/university/info/career"},{"label":"Companies","path":"/en/university/info/career/companies"},{"label":"Company profiles","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Are you looking for an internship, a job, a collaboration for a thesis, or a field project?</p> <p>Discover the main employers that collaborate with USI: who they are, where they work and their opportunities to USI students and graduates. In this Placement Library you will find the company profiles of several companies with useful information and contacts for your internship or future career.</p> <p><strong>Search the Company profiles by</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/en/university/info/career/companies/company-profiles/companies\">Company's name</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/university/info/career/companies/company-profiles/sectors\">Sector</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/university/info/career/companies/company-profiles/companies-ticino\">Offices in Ticino</a></li> </ul> <p>Are you a company, an institution or an organisation and would like to post your Company profile online? Go on the <a href=\"https://careergate.usi.ch/\">USI CareerGate</a> platform.</p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Career","href":"/en/university/info/career"},{"label":"Internship","hr